1
00:00:12,288 --> 00:00:19,148
Tu as vu cette publication ? Elle dit que la mairie va supprimer tous les bus de nuit.
Did you see that post? It says the town hall is going to cancel all the night buses.

2
00:00:19,248 --> 00:00:24,356
Je doute que ce soit vrai. Quelle est la source ?
I doubt it's true. What's the source?

3
00:00:24,456 --> 00:00:29,660
Aucune. C'est peut-être une fausse information.
None. It's perhaps fake news.

4
00:00:29,760 --> 00:00:37,028
Il se peut qu'elle ait été mal comprise. Il faudrait vérifier sur le site officiel.
It may have been misunderstood. We should check the official website.

5
00:00:37,128 --> 00:00:43,316
Tu as raison. Sans doute que la mairie a déjà publié un démenti.
You're right. The town hall has probably already published a denial.

6
00:00:43,416 --> 00:00:49,436
Je suis sûre que oui. On ne partage pas avant d'être certains.
I'm sure it has. We don't share before being certain.
